\viewkind4\uc1\pard\cf1\ul\b\f0\fs24\'b6 Verse 1\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 1 O GOD, to whom the faithful dead
\par Still live, uited to their Head,
\par Their Lord and ours the same; 
\par For all Thy saints, to memory dear,
\par Departed in Thy faith and fear,
\par We bless They holy name.
\par  
\par \cf1\ul\b\'b6 Verse 2\cf0\ulnone\b0 
\par 2 By the same grace upheld, may we 
\par So follow those who followed Thee, 
\par As with them to partake 
\par The full reward of heacenly bliss:
\par Merciful Father, grant us this 
\par For our Redeemers sake.
\par \f1 
\par \cf1\ul\b\fs16 
\par }

